description "The Exile

A veteran Jedi general from the Mandalorian Wars. A wound in the force with a aptitude for leadership and versatility.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- The Exile's Lightsaber
- Exile's Lightsaber Staff (Staff/Blue/Red)
- Single Light Saber (Yellow/Red/Purple)
- Dual Sabers (Duals/Cyan/Purple)
- Shoto Lightsaber (Cyan/Purple/Red/Yellow)
-- Saber/Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (2)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (1)
- Sense (1)
- Push (2)
- Pull (1)

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (1)
- Rally
- Healing (1)
- Force Block (1)
- Anti Mind Trick (1)"
